    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "This photo comes from the second national wave of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Cross_Check\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Operation Cross Check\">Operation Cross Check</a>, an effort by ICE to arrest and deport undocumented immigrants with criminal records. Over 2,900 people were arrested and 18 weapons were confiscated. (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.ice.gov/news/releases/1109/110928washingtondc.htm\">http://www.ice.gov/news/releases/1109/110928washingtondc.htm</a>[ Press release], September 28, 2011.)",
